WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.519 --> 00:00:06.719
Why, oh why do elections have to end with
the winning candidates being carried

cue-2
00:00:06.719 --> 00:00:07.659
through the streets?

cue-3
00:00:08.619 --> 00:00:15.239
In an old armchair, aloft too soar, no
candidate can wish for more. Not so

cue-4
00:00:15.239 --> 00:00:20.899
likely. And, and what with the new
interest plotting to challenge the result,

cue-5
00:00:21.719 --> 00:00:24.959
my victory may soon be as shaky as my
chair.
